    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say they care, but it's just hard to believe it when everything feels so hollow. it feels like i'm just stuck in this endless loop of failing. sometimes i look at everything and it just seems so much easier to just... stop. to not have to deal with the heaviness anymore. do you think it's wrong to just want everything to end?",
