    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but talking to people just feels like more work. another person to explain myself to, another person who's eventually gonna get tired of me. i just keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i wasn't a factor in anyone's life anymore. like, wouldn't everyone just be better off if i just wasn't here? wouldn't it just be a relief for them too?",
